This is a native bare-swift package; it is not derived from any upstream
Rust crate. Implements RFC 1951 (DEFLATE Compressed Data Format
Specification version 1.3) directly. The canonical Huffman algorithm
follows the spec's § 3.2.2 procedure.

RFC 1951: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc1951.html
